# Gruum UI implementation

When adding or changing UI, reuse components from `components.css` and type/color from `tokens.css`. Do not invent a new button, chip, or color.

## Do

- Buttons: `.btn` plus `.btn-primary` / `.btn-secondary` / `.btn-white` / `.btn-tertiary`
- Type: `.headline-main` `.headline-secondary` `.headline-small` `.body-normal` `.body-small` …
- Color: `var(--text-primary)`, `var(--semantic-button)`, never a raw hex
- Radius/shadow: `var(--corner-medium)`, `var(--shadow-button-primary)`, …

## Don’t

```html
<button class="my-special-button">Save</button>
```

```css
.my-special-button { background: #505050; }
```

A `postToolUse` / `stop` hook in `.cursor/hooks.json` fails the turn if new HTML/CSS uses raw color or an invented `button` class. Fix FAILs before finishing.
